<content>
  <section><title>Getting Ready for Unit 4</title>
<para>To be ready for this unit, you need to be able to:</para>
<list>
  <item>Find the slope of the line that goes through two points on a graph.</item>
  <item>Interpret the meaning of a situation from a graph. </item>
  <item>Use a pattern to find the next term in a sequence.</item>
</list>
<para>Next, you will answer some questions that will help you see how ready you are for this unit. If you need help, some mini-lessons will help you brush up on anything you need to work on.</para></section>
</content>
